Package: kbolt
Type: Package
Title: Fast Exact DNA K-mer Counting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("nireo", email = "eemil.lehtikangas1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast exact DNA k-mer counting backed by the kbolt Rust library.
    Supports streaming plain and gzipped FASTA/FASTQ files in parallel,
    in-memory and disk-backed counting, vectorized k-mer lookups, count
    histograms, top-k extraction, filtered data.frame export, and streaming
    binary count databases.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.85)
NeedsCompilation: yes
